{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15219280","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15219280","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1521928001:1":{"text":"元気を出して……もう泣かないでください。\nそれにここは危険なので、そろそろ離れないといけません。","source_cn":"请振作一点，别再哭了。\\n这里不是很安全，要尽快离开才行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE107A0996A4D7F10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521928002:1":{"text":"はい……分かってます。","source_cn":"对……你说得对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D4F6F9DF4B366FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521928003:1":{"text":"レイニー、ホーリン城に行ってみたい？\n……おばさんと一緒に暮らすの。","source_cn":"蕾妮，你想不想去呼临城？\\n……和南茜阿姨一起生活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D4D1AC97A27A8FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521928004:1":{"text":"えっ……","source_cn":"咦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDD605D1B2399700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521928005:1":{"text":"ホーリン城……そこは安全なの？前までのトータス町みたいに、いいところ……？","source_cn":"呼临城……那里安全吗？像图塔镇一样好吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BE128A20EF138CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_titl